Here is a complete HTML file that recreates a pixel-perfect Space Invaders game, based on the original 1978 Taito arcade cabinet.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders · 1978 Taito Cabinet</title>
  <style>
    /* === RESET & BASE === */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background: #111;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }

    /* === CABINET WRAPPER === */
    .cabinet {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      border: 6px solid #000;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #333, 0 0 20px #000;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* MARQUEE / TITLE */
    .marquee {
      background: #000;
      color: #f0f0f0;
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px #f0f0f0, 0 0 12px #f0f0f0;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border: 2px solid #555;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.2;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .marquee span {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #000;
      padding: 0 6px;
    }

